            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Southern states exhibit highest structural vulnerability.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Many vulnerable counties also suffer from low hospital density.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>However, hospital density alone does not fully explain vulnerability; social determinants matter.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Healthcare deserts are geographically clustered in rural and Southern regions.</run>
